in\n                              questione, nonché conservate in una forma\n                              che consenta l\'identificazione di questo/i\n                              ultimo/i per un arco di tempo non\n                              superiore al perseguimento di tali\n                              finalità, ai sensi dell\'art. 6 del reg.\n                              (U.E.) n. 679/2016.</b></i></span></div>\n                      <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span\nstyle=\"font-size:7.1pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;\nmso-fareast-language:IT\"><i><b>Ogni trattamento delle suddette\n                              informazioni contrario alle appena\n                              descritte condizioni svolto da parte del/i\n                              destinatario/i potrà porre in capo\n                              allo/agli stesso/i la responsabilità di\n                              risarcire l\'eventuale danno materiale o\n                              immateriale subito dall\'/dagli\n                              interessato/i in questione, ai sensi\n                              dell\'art. 82 del reg. (U.E.) n.679/2016.</b></i></span></div>\n                      <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span\nstyle=\"font-size:7.1pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;\nmso-fareast-language:IT\"><i><b>Qualora il/i destinatario/i abbia/abbiano\n                              ricevuto il presente messaggio ed i\n                              presenti eventuali allegati per errore,\n                              lo/gli stesso/i è/sono pregato/i di\n                              riferirlo immediatamente al sottoscritto\n                              via contatto  telefonico (0721-860543) o\n                              via e-mail (<a\n                                href=\"mailto:info@suoloesalute.it\"\n                                target=\"_blank\"\n                                style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\n                                class=\"moz-txt-link-freetext\">info@suoloesalute.it</a>)\n                              e di provvedere contemporaneamente alla\n                              cancellazione dello stesso e degli\n                              eventuali stessi.</b></i></span></div>\n                      <span\nstyle=\"font-size:7.1pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none;\nmso-fareast-language:IT\"><i>The message and any attachments transmitted\n                          by the undersigned may contain information of\n                          a confidential nature, including personal\n                          data, which, therefore, are reserved for the\n                          exclusive processing by the recipient (s) for\n                          the purposes with the same / I agreed to or to\n                          the same (s) communicated and, in any case,\n                          illustrated to the interested party (s) in\n                          question, as well as stored in a form that\n                          allows identification of this last (s) for a\n                          period of time not exceeding in pursuit of\n                          these purposes, pursuant to art. 6 of the reg.\n                          (U.E.) n. 679/2016.</i><br>\n                        <i>Any processing of the aforementioned\n                          information contrary to the conditions\n                          described above by the recipient (s) may place\n                          the responsibility of the latter (s) to\n                          compensate for any material or immaterial\n                          damage suffered by the interested party (s) in\n                          question, pursuant to art. 82 of the reg.\n                          (U.E.) n.679 / 2016.</i><br>\n                        <i>If the recipient (s) has / have received the\n                          present message and any eventual attachments\n                          by mistake, the same (s) is / are requested to\n                          report it immediately to the undersigned by\n                          contact  telephone (0721-860543) or via e-mail\n                          (<a href=\"mailto:info@suoloesalute.it\"\n                            target=\"_blank\"\n                            style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\"\n                            class=\"moz-txt-link-freetext\">info@suoloesalute.it</a>)\n                          and to simultaneously provide for the\n                          cancellation of the same and of the same.</i></span></div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <br>\n    <div class=\"moz-cite-prefix\">Il 17/03/2026 11:39, Mediaprint S.r.l.\n      ha scritto:<br>\n    </div>\n    <blockquote type=\"cite\"\ncite=\"mid:0V7PQXuCGTU40wdpHpayinp9UOgY4vGdb3e2oU1r7Cc@www.mediaprint.it\">\n      <meta http-equiv=\"content-type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n      <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n      <!-- utf-8 works for most cases -->\n      <meta name=\"viewport\"\n        content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n      <!-- Forcing initial-scale shouldn\'t be necessary -->\n      <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n      <!-- Use the latest (edge) version of IE rendering engine -->\n      <title>Credenziali accesso Area FTP</title>\n      <!-- The title tag shows in email notifications, like Android 4.4. -->\n      <!-- Please use an inliner tool to convert all CSS to inline as inpage or external CSS is removed by email clients -->\n      <!-- important in CSS is used to prevent the styles of currently inline CSS from overriding the ones mentioned in media queries when corresponding screen sizes are encountered -->\n      <!-- CSS Reset -->\n      <style type=\"text/css\">html,\n                    body {\n                        margin: 0 !important;\n                        padding: 0 !important;\n                        height: 100% !important;\n                        width: 100% !important;\n                    }* {\n                        -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;\n                        -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\n                    }.ExternalClass {\n                        width: 100%;\n                    }div[style*=\"margin: 16px 0\"] {\n                        margin: 0 !important;\n                    }table,\n                    td {\n                        mso-table-lspace: 0pt !important;\n                        mso-table-rspace: 0pt !important;\n                    }table {\n                        border-spacing: 0 !important;\n                        border-collapse: collapse !important;\n                        table-layout: fixed !important;\n                        margin: 0 auto !important;\n                    }table table table {\n                        table-layout: auto;\n                    }img {\n                        -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;\n                    }.yshortcuts a {\n                        border-bottom: none !important;\n                    }a[x-apple-data-detectors] {\n                        color: inherit !important;\n                    }</style>\n      <!-- Progressive Enhancements -->\n      <style type=\"text/css\">.button-td,\n                    .button-a {\n                        transition: all 100ms ease-in;\n                    }.button-td:hover,\n                    .button-a:hover {\n                        background: #59b473 !important;\n                 