emFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'SF Pro Icons\'; padding: 0; padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px; width: 100%; text-align: left;\" width=\"100%\" align=\"left\">\r\n														<p class=\"h4\" style=\"font-family: \'CSClarity\', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'SF Pro Icons\'; Margin: 0; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">Spett.le MEDIAPRINT SRL - TE,\r\n															<br style=\"font-family: \'CSClarity\', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'SF Pro Icons\';\"><br style=\"font-family: \'CSClarity\', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'SF Pro Icons\';\">\r\n															La prova gratuita che ti abbiamo riservato come <strong style=\"font-family: \'CSClarity\', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'SF Pro Icons\';\">omaggio per la tua azienda</strong> è terminata...<strong style=\"font-family: \'CSClarity\', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'SF Pro Icons\';\"> ma non è ancora troppo tardi per approfittarne!</strong>\r\n															<br style=\"font-family: \'CSClarity\', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'SF Pro Icons\';\">Se non hai avuto tempo oppure se vuoi valutare ancora per un po\' il servizio hai la possibilità di estendere l\'accesso, SENZA ALCUN COSTO per altri 7 giorni.\r\n														</p>\r\n                                                    </td>\r\n                                                </tr>\r\n                                            </table>\r\n                                        </td>\r\n                                    </tr>\r\n									<tr style=\"font-family: \'CSClarity\', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'SF Pro Icons\';\">\r\n                                        <td class=\"full-width-image\" style=\"font-family: \'CSClarity\', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'SF Pro Icons\'; padding: 0;\">\r\n                                            <img src=\"https://appalti.org/images/notifica_mail/top-round-30_trasp.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"\" style=\"font-family: \'CSClarity\', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'SF Pro Icons\'; border: 0; display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; height: auto;\">\r\n                                        </td>\r\n                                    </tr>\r\n                                    <tr style=\"font-family: \'CSClarity\', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'SF Pro Icons\';\">\r\n                                        <td class=\"one-column bg-white\" style=\"font-family: \'CSClarity\', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'SF Pro Icons\'; padding: 0; background-color: #ffffff;\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\">\r\n                                            <table width=\"100%\" style=\"font-family: \'CSClarity\', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'SF Pro Icons\'; border-spacing: 0; color: #333333;\">\r\n                                                <tr style=\"font-family: \'CSClarity\', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'SF Pro Icons\';\">\r\n                               